<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following major South</p>
<p>African economic indicators are scheduled for release next week:</p>
<p>DAY    GMT   INDICATOR    PERIOD  FORECAST   RANGE	PREVIOUS</p>
<p>TUES   0900  CPI Y/Y	DEC     9.6	9.34/9.9     9.2</p>
<p>TUES   0900  CPI M/M	DEC     1.0	0.9/1.4	0.4</p>
<p>TUES   1500  PRELIM M3    DEC     14.3     14.0/14.8    15.32</p>
<p>TUES   1500  PRIV CREDIT  DEC     16.3     15.6/17.0    17.10</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
